#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:3
#: fd325ab56f214617b53a879a980b0c64
msgid "剪切矩阵应变（Shear Matrix Strain）"
msgstr "Shear Matrix Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:5
#: 4cf5d8dc22874481979868f713c0286b
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:7
#: 66c63170745f4c4990a35ae81dfec7c5
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:9
#: fbf3ec6c94b142c5bae39add0fcc35c5
msgid "在固定的全局笛卡尔 $x/y/z$ 坐标系中扫描剪切矩阵分量。它适合生成简单剪切路径，或补充非对角应变张量分量。"
msgstr ""
"Scan shear-matrix components in a fixed global Cartesian $x/y/z$ coordinate system. "
"Use this card to generate simple-shear paths or to sample off-diagonal strain-tensor "
"components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:11
#: 3d35eb6fef234e16a9c8cde0f4cc9293
msgid "这里的 `xy`、`yz`、`xz` 指笛卡尔矩阵分量，不是晶格矢量 $a/b/c$ 的组合。对旋转或三斜晶胞仍使用同一全局笛卡尔定义。"
msgstr ""
"Here `xy`, `yz`, and `xz` are Cartesian matrix components, not combinations of "
"lattice vectors $a/b/c$. The same global Cartesian definition is used for rotated and"
" triclinic cells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:13
#: a6ab59e3d3ad4869a40529c56379dcc0
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:15
#: 28e02659e8514e58885da13cdc18a74d
msgid "程序按 ASE 的行矢量晶胞约定计算："
msgstr "The program follows ASE's row-vector cell convention:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:17
#: a1c22ed683d9431890f805634ce5bbda
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf C'=\\mathbf C\\mathbf S.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:21
#: 25a5509223e04e70b430bed97af54143
msgid "简单剪切 γij"
msgstr "Simple Shear γij"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:23
#: a45142fd537045bcb2fd7afad362f4bf
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf S_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & \\gamma_{xy} & \\gamma_{xz}\\\\\n"
"0 & 1 & \\gamma_{yz}\\\\\n"
"0 & 0 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:32
#: f3dbff5b750a40cdaae38a159ff91cea
#, python-brace-format
msgid "界面输入单位为百分数，例如 `xy = 5%` 表示 $\\gamma_{xy}=0.05$。坐标变换可写成："
msgstr ""
"Interface values are percentages. For example, `xy = 5%` means $\\gamma_{xy}=0.05$. "
"The coordinate transformation can be written as:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:34
#: dd01748fa43b41239d09535e28db674b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x'=x,\\qquad\n"
"y'=y+\\gamma_{xy}x,\\qquad\n"
"z'=z+\\gamma_{xz}x+\\gamma_{yz}y.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:40
#: abf5de0b81114d9d94b3ebbee4cefcf2
msgid "对称应变 εij"
msgstr "Symmetric Strain εij"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:42
#: 5dd66f68cdbc48a08496d833a2e0e360
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf S_{\\mathrm{symmetric}}=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & \\varepsilon_{xy} & \\varepsilon_{xz}\\\\\n"
"\\varepsilon_{xy} & 1 & \\varepsilon_{yz}\\\\\n"
"\\varepsilon_{xz} & \\varepsilon_{yz} & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:51
#: b154c52668e44185ae19cf31780f0a6a
msgid "此模式的输入是应变张量非对角分量。在线性小应变约定下，工程剪切量满足："
msgstr ""
"Inputs in this mode are off-diagonal strain-tensor components. Under the linear "
"small-strain convention, engineering shear satisfies:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:53
#: 390fd6abe03a4803ac050cb629f06ab1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\gamma_{ij}=2\\varepsilon_{ij}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:57
#: f42552926c4c4d33b25bc292324c6649
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"因此，对称模式输入 `5%` 表示 $\\varepsilon_{xy}=0.05$，对应工程剪切量 $\\gamma_{xy}=0.10$；它与简单剪切模式的 `5%`"
" 不是同一个物理幅度。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, `5%` in symmetric mode means $\\varepsilon_{xy}=0.05$, corresponding to "
"engineering shear $\\gamma_{xy}=0.10$. It is not the same physical magnitude as `5%` "
"in simple-shear mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:59
#: 65f90b7a5cb945b09b7ccb498a7f4a76
msgid "原子分数坐标随晶胞保持不变。`spin:R:3` 与 ASE `initial_magmoms` 保留输入全局坐标系中的笛卡尔分量，不随晶胞形变改写。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic fractional coordinates remain fixed relative to the cell. `spin:R:3` and ASE "
"`initial_magmoms` retain their Cartesian components in the input global coordinate "
"system and are not transformed with the cell deformation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:61
#: 3b7419fa736c4b409591703e87fb3a03
#, python-brace-format
msgid "若三条范围分别产生 $N_{xy}$、$N_{yz}$、$N_{xz}$ 个值，则："
msgstr "If the three ranges produce $N_{xy}$, $N_{yz}$, and $N_{xz}$ values, respectively:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:63
#: 363eebe89d3b4111a99bdbd2701ecb6f
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}N_{xy}N_{yz}N_{xz}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:67
#: fc200a3e53b64cb188ba9c6edb751f8d
msgid "默认每条范围为 `[-2, 2, 2]`%，对应小应变弹性响应中的负向、参考和正向三点， 因此每个输入生成 $3^3=27$ 个结构。界面会显示组合数和预计总输出数。"
msgstr ""
"Each range defaults to `[-2, 2, 2]`%, representing negative, reference, and positive "
"points for a small-strain elastic response. Each input therefore produces $3^3=27$ "
"structures. The interface shows the combination count and estimated total output "
"count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:70
#: 5185f15c38764c8cbfd49ded0cde8ff2
msgid "每个输出都必须保持有限、非奇异且为右手晶胞；否则程序会提示减小剪切分量。"
msgstr ""
"Every output cell must remain finite, nonsingular, and right-handed. Otherwise, the "
"program asks you to reduce the shear components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:72
#: 09fedff555ad4d2db0860353996516b5
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:74
#: 5d4e6aeed53f4e26b501b1ef4c56e963
msgid "生成 $xy$ 简单剪切路径，范围为 $-3\\%$ 到 $3\\%$，步长 $1\\%$："
msgstr "To generate an $xy$ simple-shear path from $-3\\%$ to $3\\%$ in steps of $1\\%$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:76
#: 33f2f590c07d475aa839bbd453bc7db0
msgid ""
"Deformation mode: Simple shear γij\n"
"γxy: -3, 3, 1\n"
"γyz: 0, 0, 1\n"
"γxz: 0, 0, 1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:83
#: bd2324016e274bb7aaa9312703681ef3
msgid "每个输入得到 7 个结构。`xy = 3%` 对应 $y'=y+0.03x$。不扫描的通道填写 `[0, 0, 1]`，因为步长必须为正数。"
msgstr ""
"Each input produces seven structures. `xy = 3%` corresponds to $y'=y+0.03x$. Enter "
"`[0, 0, 1]` for channels that are not scanned because the step must remain positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:85
#: f0c5c7147cee41ed85b767def8518025
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:87
#: b6227a7c3aeb4989bdd0e50592903325
msgid "xy 分量范围（xy_range）"
msgstr "xy Component Range (xy_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:89
#: ae7095a9c6c345729a1f8bcae5947dc8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`，格式为 `[min, max, step]`，单位为百分数。其含义由形变模式决定：简单剪切中为 $\\gamma_{xy}$，对称应变中为"
" $\\varepsilon_{xy}$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`, formatted as `[min, max, step]` in percent. Its meaning depends"
" on the deformation mode: $\\gamma_{xy}$ for simple shear and $\\varepsilon_{xy}$ for"
" symmetric strain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:91
#: e630c8982e474a2cbfb7ee739113901d
msgid "yz 分量范围（yz_range）"
msgstr "yz Component Range (yz_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:93
#: 02caf05e2ee44f67be644ad3d7f05b2c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。简单剪切中为 $\\gamma_{yz}$，对称应变中为 $\\varepsilon_{yz}$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Represents $\\gamma_{yz}$ for simple shear and "
"$\\varepsilon_{yz}$ for symmetric strain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:95
#: 1c9b11f19c3e40e989b17e69a8306e55
msgid "xz 分量范围（xz_range）"
msgstr "xz Component Range (xz_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:97
#: 90f40ea384174534b5c50b15ee925144
#, python-brace-format
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。简单剪切中为 $\\gamma_{xz}$，对称应变中为 $\\varepsilon_{xz}$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Represents $\\gamma_{xz}$ for simple shear and "
"$\\varepsilon_{xz}$ for symmetric strain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:99
#: 29c75a93114848318b9ed5c9d9e74b18
msgid "形变模式（symmetric）"
msgstr "Deformation Mode (symmetric)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:101
#: 37bfa073bb0b49518c7dd3428cc4f993
msgid "默认 `true`，表示对称应变张量模式；`false` 表示简单剪切模式。该字段沿用布尔序列化值，界面中以两个明确的模式名称呈现。"
msgstr ""
"Default `true`, selecting symmetric strain-tensor mode; `false` selects simple-shear "
"mode. The field retains its Boolean serialized value for compatibility, while the "
"interface presents two explicit mode names."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:103
#: d8bb2c160c4e46abb335360a47785ce8
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Preserve Detected Molecular Rigidity (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:105
#: 0a4d2a3b06fc4dfdafe48740be4be0cb
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，程序在晶胞仿射形变后恢复检测到的分子团内部几何。对希望保持分子内键长和键角的体系可开启。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the program restores the internal geometry of "
"detected molecular groups after the affine cell deformation. Enable it when "
"intramolecular bond lengths and angles should remain fixed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:107
#: 09fedff555ad4d2db0860353996516b5
msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:109
#: eeb19f041d1a44c9854afd48fd2dd6c2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearMatrixCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"xy_range\": [-3, 3, 1],\n"
"    \"yz_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"xz_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"symmetric\": false,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:123
#: e6f6281e6a5341e2b5c674e95b358158
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:125
#: e7d59c1644ec458695974c1fb05288ba
msgid ""
"**为什么输出数会很快增加？** 三个范围按笛卡尔积组合，默认是 $3\\times3\\times3=27$ 个结构/输入。单通道扫描时，把另外两条范围设为 `[0, "
"0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the output count grow so quickly?** The three ranges form a Cartesian "
"product, giving $3\\times3\\times3=27$ structures per input by default. For a single-"
"channel scan, set the other two ranges to `[0, 0, 1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:127
#: 71cc5ad40f4b42ed871b93b3a7f183bc
msgid ""
"**为什么对称模式和简单剪切的相同百分数效果不同？** 两者输入的物理量不同：简单剪切使用工程剪切量 $\\gamma$，对称模式使用张量分量 "
"$\\varepsilon$；在线性小应变下 $\\gamma=2\\varepsilon$。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the same percentage have different effects in symmetric and simple-shear "
"modes?** The modes accept different physical quantities: simple shear uses "
"engineering shear $\\gamma$, whereas symmetric mode uses tensor component "
"$\\varepsilon$. Under linear small strain, $\\gamma=2\\varepsilon$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:129
#: 9e4e73e895754bfca2d3240f1976f655
msgid "**为什么提示晶胞无效？** 当前分量组合使矩阵奇异或翻转成左手晶胞。减小范围，或避免同时使用过大的多个分量。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the cell reported as invalid?** The current component combination makes the "
"matrix singular or flips it into a left-handed cell. Reduce the ranges or avoid "
"combining several large components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:131
#: 884b832a43844d328118629b04ed76e6
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:133
#: d71771f1775a495995d425fa3c39413e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Shr(xy={sxy}%,yz={syz}%,xz={sxz}%,mode={simple|symmetric})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:135
#: 8a17e665eaae43bc9261a1e93e8c1549
msgid "零分量也会明确记录。全零组合是严格 no-op；该操作无随机性。"
msgstr ""
"Zero components are recorded explicitly. The all-zero combination is an exact no-op, "
"and the operation has no randomness."

#~ msgid "`yz_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 yz）—— 注意要把步长非零的值写进去，否则 range 为空不生成"
#~ msgstr "`yz_range` = `[0,0,1]` (one zero point; the step must be nonzero)"

#~ msgid "`xz_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 xz）"
#~ msgstr "`xz_range` = `[0,0,1]`"

#~ msgid "体系本身是刚性分子晶体，剪切只会破坏分子内拓扑 → 考虑 `identify_organic`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The system is molecular and shear would "
#~ "distort intramolecular topology without molecular "
#~ "protection"

#~ msgid "通过 xy/yz/xz 剪切矩阵分量生成非对角形变样本。对晶格矢量的三个剪切通道做系统扫描，每个通道独立控制 min/max/step。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate off-diagonal deformations by scanning "
#~ "xy, yz, and xz shear-matrix components, "
#~ "each with an independent minimum, maximum, and"
#~ " step."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\gamma_{xy}=\\frac{s_{xy}}{100},\\quad "
#~ "\\mathbf{S}=\\begin{bmatrix}1&\\gamma_{xy}&\\gamma_{xz}\\\\0&1&\\gamma_{yz}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad"
#~ " \\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}\\mathbf{S}"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`symmetric=true` 时填充 S 的下三角对应项，使剪切路径更接近对称形变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `symmetric=true`, matching lower-triangular "
#~ "entries are filled to form a symmetric "
#~ "strain-like path."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $s_{xy},s_{yz},s_{xz}$ 是界面输入的百分数，$\\gamma$ 是无量纲剪切量。 "
#~ "非对称模式是简单剪切；对称模式同时填入转置位置。原子分数坐标保持不变。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "场景：模型预测剪切模量 C44 比 DFT 低 40%"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Predicted C44 is 40% below DFT"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 fcc Al 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，C11/C12 都对，但 C44"
#~ " 只有 DFT 值的 60%。诊断发现：C44 是对应于 xy/yz/xz "
#~ "方向剪切的分量，而训练集里所有结构都是轴向拉伸/压缩（通过 `Lattice Strain` "
#~ "生成的），模型没见过非对角剪切变形。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An fcc Al NEP reproduces C11 and C12 "
#~ "but predicts only 60% of the DFT C44."
#~ " Its training set contains axial strains "
#~ "but no off-diagonal shear states."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 剪切弹性常数来源于非对角应变。如果训练集只覆盖对角应变（axial "
#~ "strain），模型对剪切方向的刚度完全靠外推。需要往训练集里加入已知剪切分量的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Shear elastic constants derive from"
#~ " off-diagonal strain response. Add cells "
#~ "with controlled shear components so that "
#~ "response is interpolated."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 fcc Al 单胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed fcc Al cell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 沿 xy 方向做 -3% 到 +3% 剪切，步长 1%，对称模式，共 7 个结构"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Scan symmetric xy shear from -3% to +3% in 1% steps."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`XY 剪切范围`（`xy_range`） = `[-3, 3, 1]`"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`YZ 剪切范围`（`yz_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 yz）—— 注意要把步长非零的值写进去，否则 range 为空不生成"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`XZ 剪切范围`（`xz_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 xz）"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`对称剪切`（`symmetric`） = `true`"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 7 个结构，剪切矩阵的 xy 分量从 -0.03 到 +0.03，yz 和 xz 分量为 0"
#~ msgstr "**Output:** Seven structures with xy from -0.03 to +0.03 and zero yz/xz components."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后重新计算弹性常数矩阵，C44 应该更接近 DFT 参考值"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After labeling and retraining, recompute the "
#~ "elastic tensor; C44 should approach the DFT"
#~ " reference."

#~ msgid "检查输出结构的晶格角变化：单斜/triclinic 体系剪切后角度会偏离正交，确认变化在物理合理范围"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect resulting cell angles and confirm that"
#~ " nonorthogonality remains in the intended range."

#~ msgid "如果 C44 改善但 C55/C66 仍有偏差，再单独扫 yz_range 和 xz_range"
